#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "56_The Florist"
msgid "Kiryu. What's the big idea, bringing some random guy in here\\r\nwithout warning me first?"
msgstr "Kiryu, ¿qué se supone que haces trayendo a un tipo cualquiera aquí\\r sin avisarme primero?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Kiryu"
msgid "He isn't a random guy. This is Takashi. Don't you remember\\r\nhim from a few years ago?"
msgstr "No es un cualquiera. Es Takashi. ¿No lo recuerda\\r de hace unos años?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=2
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P2
#. y4:msg_speaker=The Florist
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "80_The Florist"
msgid "...Sure, I guess."
msgstr "...Sí, supongo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=The Florist
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "92_The Florist"
msgid "Anyway, what do you want with me?"
msgstr "En fin, ¿qué quieren de mí?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P4
#. y4:msg_speaker=Takashi
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
msgctxt "104_Takashi"
msgid "Well, um! I need your help finding someone."
msgstr "¡Bueno, eh! Necesito tu ayuda para encontrar a alguien."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=5
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P5
#. y4:msg_speaker=The Florist
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "116_The Florist"
msgid "Oh yeah? And who might that someone be?"
msgstr "¿Ah, sí? ¿Y quién sería esa persona?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Takashi
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
msgctxt "128_Takashi"
msgid "My father. It's really important."
msgstr "Mi padre. Es muy importante para mí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "140_Kiryu"
msgid "Your dad?"
msgstr "¿Tu padre?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=11
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P11
#. y4:msg_speaker=The Florist
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "188_The Florist"
msgid "What do you need him for?"
msgstr "¿Para qué necesitas encontrarlo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Takashi
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
msgctxt "200_Takashi"
msgid "Well, you see, my girlfriend, Kyoka... She got pregnant recently."
msgstr "Pues verás, mi novia, Kyoka... Recientemente quedó embarazada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=The Florist
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "212_The Florist"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "¡¿Qué?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Takashi"
msgid "I've been working retail and bringing in a decent income for\\r\na while now, so we've been planning to tie the knot soon."
msgstr "He estado trabajando en ventas y ganando un buen sueldo desde\\r hace un tiempo, así que estábamos pensando en casarnos pronto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Takashi"
msgid "Honestly, having a little baby on the way is like a dream\\r\ncome true."
msgstr "A decir verdad, saber que pronto seré padre es como un sueño\\r\nhecho realidad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Takashi"
msgid "But once we started talking about the wedding, I realized...\\r\nthere's nobody I can invite from my family. My mom passed\\r\naway a long time ago."
msgstr "Pero cuando empezamos a planear la boda, me di cuenta...\\r que no hay nadie de mi familia a quien pueda invitar. Mi madre falleció\\r hace mucho tiempo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=17
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P17
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "260_Kiryu"
msgid "And that's why you're looking for your father."
msgstr "Así que por eso estás buscando a tu padre."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=18
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P18
#. y4:msg_speaker=Takashi
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
msgctxt "272_Takashi"
msgid "Yeah. Now more than ever, I need him in my life."
msgstr "Sí. Ahora, más que nunca, lo necesito en mi vida."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=19
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P19
#. y4:msg_speaker=The Florist
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "284_The Florist"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_The Florist"
msgid "Listen, kid. Let's say I do track your old man down. Are you\\r\nreally sure you're ready to see him?"
msgstr "Escucha, muchacho. Supongamos que encuentro a tu viejo. ¿Estás\\r realmente seguro de que estás listo para verlo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=21
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P21
#. y4:msg_speaker=Takashi
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
msgctxt "308_Takashi"
msgid "Huh? What do you mean?"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿A qué se refiere?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "320_The Florist"
msgid "Things must've been rough for you without a father figure\\r\naround. Deep down, don't you hold it against him?"
msgstr "Debe haber sido duro para ti crecer sin un padre\\r presente. En el fondo, ¿no le guardas rencor por eso?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=23
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P23
#. y4:msg_speaker=The Florist
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "332_The Florist"
msgid "Wouldn't it be better if he was just gone for good?"
msgstr "¿No sería mejor que desapareciera para siempre?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=24
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P24
#. y4:msg_speaker=Takashi
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
msgctxt "344_Takashi"
msgid "Honestly?"
msgstr "¿Siendo sincero?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=25
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P25
#. y4:msg_speaker=Takashi
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
msgctxt "356_Takashi"
msgid "I'm not really sure."
msgstr "No estoy muy seguro."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "368_Takashi"
msgid "But I'm going to be responsible for a family now... so it's\\r\ntime to put my own issues behind me and think of what's best\\r\nfor my wife and child."
msgstr "Pero ahora que voy a responsabilizarme de una familia... es hora de\\r dejar atrás mis problemas y pensar en lo que es mejor\\r para mi esposa e hijo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=27
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P27
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "380_Kiryu"
msgid "Takashi..."
msgstr "Takashi..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=28
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P28
#. y4:msg_speaker=The Florist
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "392_The Florist"
msgid "...All right. I can help you."
msgstr "...De acuerdo. Puedo ayudarte."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=29
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P29
#. y4:msg_speaker=Takashi
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
msgctxt "404_Takashi"
msgid "You can!?"
msgstr "¡¿De verdad?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=30
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P30
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "416_Kiryu"
msgid "You sure about this, Florist?"
msgstr "¿Está seguro de esto, Florista?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "428_The Florist"
msgid "Hold your horses there. I said I \"can\" help you. I didn't\\r\nsay that I necessarily <Italic>would</Italic>."
msgstr "No te apresures muchacho. Dije que \"puedo\" ayudarte. No que\n<Italic>lo haría</Italic>."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=32
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P32
#. y4:msg_speaker=Takashi
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
msgctxt "440_Takashi"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr "Ya..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "452_The Florist"
msgid "If you want me to handle this for you, you're gonna have to\\r\nmake it worth my while."
msgstr "Si quieres que me encargue de esto, vas a tener que\ndevolverme el favor de alguna manera."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "464_The Florist"
msgid "But since I'm oh-so-charitable, I'll keep my fingers out of\\r\nyour wedding fund. Hell, I know how pricey those things can\\r\nget. Instead, you're gonna be working for me."
msgstr "Pero como soy tan generoso, me mantendré al margen\\r de tu ahorros para la boda. Sé lo caras que pueden llegar a ser\\r esas cosas. A cambio, vas a trabajar para mí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=35
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P35
#. y4:msg_speaker=Takashi
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
msgctxt "476_Takashi"
msgid "Huh? Doing what?"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Qué tendría que hacer?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=36
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P36
#. y4:msg_speaker=The Florist
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "488_The Florist"
msgid "I'll tell you more later. For now, how's that sound?"
msgstr "Ya te contaré más adelante. Por ahora, ¿qué te parece?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=37
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P37
#. y4:msg_speaker=Takashi
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
msgctxt "500_Takashi"
msgid "Perfect. I'll do it!"
msgstr "Perfecto. ¡Lo haré!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=42
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P42
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "560_Kiryu"
msgid "Are you sure you can really take this request, Florist?"
msgstr "¿Está seguro de que realmente puede hacerse cargo de esta solicitud, Florista?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=43
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P43
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "572_Kiryu"
msgid "I mean, that father he's been searching for... It's you."
msgstr "Quiero decir, ese padre que está buscando... es usted."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=44
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P44
#. y4:msg_speaker=The Florist
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "584_The Florist"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "596_Kiryu"
msgid "And what kind of work are you gonna have him do? He won't\\r\nlast half a second in the Coliseum."
msgstr "¿Y qué tipo de trabajo le va a encomendar? No duraría\\r ni medio segundo en el Coliseo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "608_The Florist"
msgid "I know that. The truth is, I'm gonna need your help.\\r\nActually, not just you, Kiryu."
msgstr "Lo sé. La verdad es que voy a necesitar tu ayuda.\\r Y no solo la tuya Kiryu."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=47
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P47
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "620_Kiryu"
msgid "Hm? Who are you talking about?"
msgstr "¿Hmm? ¿De quién habla?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "632_The Florist"
msgid "Heh, you'll see. Anyway, I've gotta get things ready. Take\\r\ncare of the kid for me, yeah?"
msgstr "Je, ya verás. En fin, tengo que poner todo en orden. Cuida\\r del chico por mí, ¿vale?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=49
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P49
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "644_Kiryu"
msgid "I'll do what I can."
msgstr "Haré lo que pueda."
